WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.070
Welcome Captain Flash Rider!


00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.535
Now, just need the bars,


00:03:29.565 --> 00:03:31.200
Then on to level 45.


00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.000
Flash power activated!


00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.520
Huh?


00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.260
Game interrupted by unknown player.


00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.120
Game over.


00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:55.080
Come on, mom. Play
time can wait, Willy.


00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.390
Your father's making breakfast.


00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.700
Well, can I first finish this level?


00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.170
Make up your mind.


00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.350
I thought you wanted to
help with the mission, so..


00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.810
Uh of course I want to help.


00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.350
Then if you want to help,
go and eat your breakfast with dad


00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.710
and then go to the
warehouse with him. Okay.


00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.900
Wait, you're not coming?


00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.330
Well, not yet.
I have something urgent in the lab.


00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.710
Really? What is it? Can I watch?


00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.170
End of discussion.


00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.800
Hm..


00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.170
Ah...


00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.130
Willy. Mom, please..


00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.000
Just five minutes. Okay, you win.


00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.240
But don't touch anything
on your father's desk.


00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.130
Huh? Heh..


00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.610
Yeah, especially that.


00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:49.880
Uh.. mom?


00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.990
Don't worry Willy.


00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.350
Here, watch.


00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.940
Thanks mom. By the way,
there's a little side effect.


00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:02.670
But you're in luck,
I just made a dose of the antidote.


00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.100
What for? I'm feeling just fine.


00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:10.850
Here, drink this.


00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.270
'Morning dad.


00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.500
How's it going?


00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.200
Hi Willy, I'm great.


00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.650
But things are.. a bit hairy!


00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.360
Yeah, that sounds like
another dad joke.


00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.980
Here, mom made this for you.


00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.530
Oh, thanks buddy.


00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.440
Ah, that's more like it.


00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:47.660
You know Willy,
this is the last day of our expedition.


00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:49.810
So tonight we begin our
voyage back to earth.


00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.705
Of course I know, I can't wait.


00:05:51.735 --> 00:05:53.570
I'm gonna see my friends again.


00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.270
One dino pancake, for
Captain Flash Rider.


00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:58.370
Um, thanks dad.


00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.290
I'm off, join me when you're done?


00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.520
Mm..


00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.280
Can I count on you to
help him with the mission?


00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:08.930
Mm..


00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.760
Wow, that's cool.


00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.690
Is that what I'm doing?
Taking pictures of creatures?


00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.080
Yes, one day perhaps.


00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.740
But for now,
you'll have to learn the basics.


00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:36.570
To be a good explorer, you have to
document each one of your discoveries.


00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.910
Yes, I know that dad,
but what's the mission?


00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:42.410
You have to take pictures of the samples
we brought back from the planet yesterday.


00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.970
Here, now you try.


00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.200
Mm..


00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.030
Huh?


00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.040
Like that? That's perfect.


00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.285
Soon, you will be a real explorer.


00:06:53.315 --> 00:06:55.530
Well, it's not that complicated.


00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.780
I'll leave you to it. I'll help
mom prepare for the voyage home.


00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.200
Once you're done with the last box,
the mission will be over.


00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.650
Ok, got it.


00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:06.660
One box, won't take very long.


00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:07.890
Uh..


00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.790
I'll be here forever.


00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.160
So, did you finish plotting our course?


00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:24.930
Almost done.


00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.830
Uh, did you leave Willy
alone in the warehouse?


00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:30.730
Relax, he's 10,
I think we can trust him by now.


00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.530
An asteroid field!


00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:50.740
I'm goin' to get Willy, wait here.


00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.870
Willy!


00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:56.220
Willy?


00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.080
Oh, where'd he go?


00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.660
Willy!


00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.530
What's happening?


00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.240
Wait, Willy's not with you?


00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:08.190
No, he wasn't in the warehouse.


00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.830
I'll find him.


00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.000
Willy?


00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.640
Willy are you there?


00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:16.580
Willy!


00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.290
Huh? Oh, Willy.


00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.190
I'm scared dad, what's going on?
It'll be ok, son.


00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.730
Come join us on the bridge.


00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:26.960
I'm coming.


00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:30.940
The shield just gave out!


00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.140
Security protocol has been activated!


00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.430
NO! Open the door!


00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.290
There's nothing we can do Willy,
it's locked, I'm sorry.


00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:40.610
Get in the pod, you'll
be safe in there.


00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:55.380
Ejection sequence initiated.


00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.920
Oh no! Come back!


00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.850
No!


00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.020
Huh?


00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.110
Willy! Mom?


00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:22.230
Willy are you ok? Yeah, I'm ok.


00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.600
Are you coming for me?


00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:27.410
Listen to me, son, we might be seperated for
a little while, but you don't need to worry.


00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.090
Your mom and I will take care
of everything, we'll find you.


00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.060
Follow the instructions until then.


00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.790
What?


00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.250
- Follow...
- But Dad!


00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:36.480
Understand?


00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.780
But..


00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:39.360
Where..


00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:40.820
Where I am?


00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:01.630
Uh..


00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:02.860
Hello?


00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:06.730
Subject: Male.


00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:07.910
Age: 10.


00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.390
First name: William.


00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.610
Hello Mr. William.


00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:13.320
I am your personal survival module


00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.030
for cases of emergency landing


00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.775
on an unknown planet.


00:12:16.805 --> 00:12:18.520
Unit B.U.C.K. 0813.


00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.840
But you can call me Buck.


00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.540
Do you have any questions Mr William?


00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:22.770
Uh..


00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:23.800
Sure.


00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.030
Where are we?


00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:29.530
On an unknown planet.


00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:33.110
Atmospheric analysis - ok.


00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.670
Oxygen detected.


00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.740
- Unlocking hatch.
- Huh?


00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.760
Wait, what are you doing?


00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.550
Please remain in the pod,
while I inspect the terrain.


00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.935
Why don't we take off now?


00:12:49.965 --> 00:12:51.660
I have to find my parents.


00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.400
Impossible maneuver.


00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.570
This emergency pod was
designed for landing,


00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:57.800
not taking off.


00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.210
But..


00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.840
How'm I gonna find them?


00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:02.640
They will find you.


00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.640
When a space traveller disappears,


00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.720
Dozens of search probes are
launched to initiate a rescue.


00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:18.780
This transmitter broadcasts
a continuous distress signal.


00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.380
When a probe is in
proximity to this planet


00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.280
it'll pick up the signal,
transmit it to a near by ship


00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.380
and a rescue will be launched.


00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:29.380
So we just wait for a probe to fly by


00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.260
and I'll find my parents, right?


00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.940
Absolutely Mr. William.


00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.730
And when do we get this probe?


00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:39.210
No idea.


00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.200
Huh...


00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:44.780
But do not worry, the pod contains
everything necessary for survival.


00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.300
Broccoli pure.


00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.150
Broccoli pure.


00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.510
Human behavior database -


00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.400
Mouth corners turned down,


00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.285
and occular humidity indicates


00:14:14.315 --> 00:14:16.170
a degraded emotional state.


00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:19.500
Recommendation - entertain the subject.


00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.700
Discovery kit.


00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.660
Unknown planet edition. Huh?


00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:43.840
Wow, check it out!


00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:50.010
Uh, what?


00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.150
Huh?


00:14:56.995 --> 00:14:58.195
Hah.


00:14:58.225 --> 00:14:59.425
Uh-huh.


00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:02.910
Alright!


00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:04.210
Uh.


00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.370
Ah.


00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.300
Oww.


00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:13.990
Whoah!


00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.820
Entertainment successful.


00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.870
Emotional state improved,
mission accomplished.


00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:26.080
New battery for unit B.U.C.K. 0813.


00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.420
Fully charged.


00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:29.650
Perfect.


00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.210
Ahah!


00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.460
What are you doing, Mr. William?


00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:53.410
Just.. playing a joke.


00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.410
I am sorry, Mr. William,
I do not understand.


00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:04.120
However,
if it improves your emotional state,


00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.170
please go on.


00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.100
I shall continue to
follow this little dot


00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:08.500
for as long as you want me to.


00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.980
Huh?


00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.210
Whatever.


00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.980
Cool, Choco Crunches.


00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.830
Umm.


00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.090
Human behaviour database -


00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.180
mouth corners turned up


00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.410
express contentment.


00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:48.460
Like that?


00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:49.850
That's perfect.


00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.980
Soon, you will be a real explorer.


00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.030
Great.


00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:02.305
I'm the first human to
explore this planet


00:17:02.335 --> 00:17:04.580
and there're only rocks to photograph.


00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:07.230
Oh well, you gotta start somewhere.


00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.560
Local weather conditions
require consistent hydration.


00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.625
Here, Mr. William. Not now Buck.


00:17:14.655 --> 00:17:16.690
I still need this whole side.


00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.790
It is very strange.


00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:24.770
I did not pick up any seismic
activity in this area.


00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:29.950
Uh, that doesn't look
like an earthquake.


00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.640
Remain calm Mr. William.


00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:59.200
Sometimes the biggest creatures
are not always the dangerous ones.


00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.090
Sometimes they are.


00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.320
Run!


00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:22.120
Priority number one,
retrieve transmitter.


00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.550
Without it, we will never be found.


00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.640
Wow, cool!


00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.565
Priority number two,


00:18:43.595 --> 00:18:45.150
retrieve battery pack.


00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:23.250
Estimated time of
collision with hostile,


00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.585
18 seconds.


00:19:24.615 --> 00:19:25.812
Recommendation,


00:19:25.842 --> 00:19:27.042
high speed motion.


00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.417
Can you hold on to this while I
transport us out of harms way?


00:19:31.447 --> 00:19:32.647
Ok!


00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:37.430
Climb aboard, Mr. William.


00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.785
Uh, but I never learned to ride a bike.


00:19:39.815 --> 00:19:42.140
Do not worry, I will do the driving.


00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:43.630
Uh, ok.


00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.860
Oh no.


00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.320
Ahh!


00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.840
Buck, I dropped the battery back there.


00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.230
Adverse conditions for
retrieval attempt.


00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.910
Hey Buck, we'll never fit!


00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.940
Indeed Mr. William, we will not.


00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.340
Unless you lower your head


00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.640
13 centimetres.


00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:31.870
Huh?


00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:56.850
Perfect.


00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.610
We are out of range of those creatures.


00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:00.390
You may now get off, Mr. William.


00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:04.865
Huh? We made it?


00:22:04.895 --> 00:22:06.392
We're alive?


00:22:06.422 --> 00:22:07.661
Thankyou Buck.


00:22:07.691 --> 00:22:08.930
Give me five.


00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:12.890
Entry, the phrase, to give five


00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.500
identified in Earth customs register.


00:22:16.150 --> 00:22:17.570
Five.


00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.990
Uhh..


00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:21.040
Oww, oww, uhh, uhh.


00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.500
Eeh.. Oww, oww.


00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:24.730
Ooh ooh.


00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:27.420
But Buck,


00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:28.810
the pod was destroyed.


00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:31.600
How are we supposed to send the signal?
Do not worry Mr. William.


00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:34.670
I can power the transmitter myself.


00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:42.210
You're actually not
too bad for a robot.


00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:45.140
The grapnel, and the
bike, that was so..


00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:48.240
Wait for me here,
I will check that it is perfectly safe.


00:22:54.241 --> 00:22:56.241
You can come out, Mr. William.


00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:05.160
Wow.


00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:22.995
In the forest we should
find enough sustenance


00:23:23.025 --> 00:23:25.130
to replace the rations
we lost in the desert.


00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:27.670
Tomorrow we shall go
there to set up camp.


00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:29.130
Until a probe finds us.


00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:31.830
A probe..


00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:37.680
Hey Buck, isn't that a probe?


00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:40.240
No, Mr. William.


00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:43.890
And that's a probe, isn't it?


00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:46.060
No.


00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:47.570
And that?


00:23:47.890 --> 00:23:49.090
No.


00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:52.330
- Are you sure?
- Yes.


00:23:52.540 --> 00:23:54.670
- And that?
- Still no.


00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:57.550
- That one, it's a probe, right?
- No.


00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:59.315
- And there?
- No.


00:23:59.345 --> 00:24:01.080
- There?
- No.


00:24:04.310 --> 00:24:06.410
- There..
- No.


00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:09.670
And.. there?


00:24:14.070 --> 00:24:15.740
Mr. William's safety.


00:24:15.770 --> 00:24:17.020
Ok.


00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:19.330
Signal strength, ok.


00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.530
Battery level, 72%.


00:24:22.880 --> 00:24:24.080
Ok.


00:24:45.930 --> 00:24:47.350
Wow, cool!


00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:50.060
My first photo of a creature.


00:24:58.630 --> 00:24:59.840
Buck what's the deal?


00:24:59.870 --> 00:25:01.050
Why'd you do that?


00:25:01.080 --> 00:25:03.770
I could not run the risk of
this creature attacking you.


00:25:03.800 --> 00:25:05.655
Huh? What are you talking about?


00:25:05.685 --> 00:25:07.332
What could that thing do to me?


00:25:07.362 --> 00:25:09.010
That is exactly the problem.


00:25:09.040 --> 00:25:10.510
I could not be certain.


00:25:10.540 --> 00:25:13.640
My mission is to see that
you remain safe and sound.


00:25:13.670 --> 00:25:16.770
Let us go. We must reach the
forest before nightfall.


00:25:18.370 --> 00:25:20.980
Hey, remember. I have
a mission as well.


00:25:21.010 --> 00:25:24.630
I'm an explorer, and I have to
take pictures of everything I find.


00:25:26.270 --> 00:25:27.470
Ah..


00:25:30.380 --> 00:25:31.880
Hey Buck, wait for me.


00:27:29.470 --> 00:27:31.135
No danger in proximity.


00:27:31.165 --> 00:27:32.800
Abundance of clean water.


00:27:32.830 --> 00:27:35.510
This place seems ideal
to set up our base camp.


00:27:36.340 --> 00:27:37.540
Heh?


00:27:40.660 --> 00:27:43.800
I am off to survey the perimeter
and make sure there is no danger.


00:27:43.830 --> 00:27:44.860
Please remain here.


00:27:44.890 --> 00:27:46.960
Do not move and do not touch anything.


00:27:46.990 --> 00:27:49.650
Huh? You're not going
to leave me by myself?


00:28:00.240 --> 00:28:02.320
Here. You will feel much better.


00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:04.285
Thanks, but..


00:28:04.315 --> 00:28:05.680
Buck, wait!


00:28:06.200 --> 00:28:07.550
Do not worry Mr. William.


00:28:07.970 --> 00:28:09.190
I will be back.


00:28:19.710 --> 00:28:20.910
Huh?


00:28:29.090 --> 00:28:30.370
Hey! Hello.


00:28:34.670 --> 00:28:35.870
Don't be afraid.


00:28:52.580 --> 00:28:54.550
You're not afraid of them, are you?


00:28:55.280 --> 00:28:56.690
Go away, shoo!


00:28:57.330 --> 00:28:59.080
I'll protect you, okay?


00:29:02.150 --> 00:29:03.480
Uh..


00:29:13.470 --> 00:29:14.980
Uhh..


00:29:20.540 --> 00:29:22.880
Easy now you big ugly creature.


00:29:22.910 --> 00:29:24.110
Easy..


00:29:27.610 --> 00:29:29.720
Oh, you're hungry, is that it?


00:29:31.470 --> 00:29:33.710
Look, some good chocolate crunch.


00:29:35.840 --> 00:29:37.810
Hmm. They're so delicious..


00:29:37.840 --> 00:29:39.300
Huh?


00:29:59.430 --> 00:30:00.630
Hah? What?


00:30:00.660 --> 00:30:03.250
Mr. William,
you were to wait for me in the clearing


00:30:03.280 --> 00:30:05.500
without moving or touching anything.


00:30:05.530 --> 00:30:07.750
Ah, not a good time to talk about that.


00:30:07.780 --> 00:30:09.060
Indeed.


00:30:09.730 --> 00:30:11.840
Uh, what are you...


00:30:31.930 --> 00:30:33.130
New entry -


00:30:33.160 --> 00:30:34.660
Shocks and falls


00:30:34.690 --> 00:30:36.520
incite amusement in subject.


00:30:51.830 --> 00:30:55.460
Ha ha ha ha.


00:30:56.240 --> 00:30:58.340
You should be more careful, Mr.
William.


00:30:58.370 --> 00:30:59.770
It wasn't my fault.


00:30:59.800 --> 00:31:01.000
You should never wander.


00:31:01.030 --> 00:31:02.230
Even for hunting.


00:31:02.970 --> 00:31:04.395
But I must admit,


00:31:04.425 --> 00:31:06.047
this is a nice catch.


00:31:06.077 --> 00:31:07.700
It is absolutely edible.


00:31:07.730 --> 00:31:08.775
'Scuse me?


00:31:08.805 --> 00:31:09.820
Are you nuts?


00:31:09.850 --> 00:31:11.290
We're not gonna eat him.


00:31:11.320 --> 00:31:12.430
It's err..


00:31:12.460 --> 00:31:14.050
My faithful companion,


00:31:14.080 --> 00:31:15.480
Flash Rider.


00:31:15.510 --> 00:31:17.760
But you can call him
Flash if you prefer.


00:31:19.240 --> 00:31:20.940
If you're not going to eat it,


00:31:20.970 --> 00:31:22.670
this creature is useless to us.


00:31:22.700 --> 00:31:24.020
Correct, Mr. Flash?


00:31:28.060 --> 00:31:29.810
Stop. What are you doing?


00:31:31.920 --> 00:31:33.760
But he looked so friendly Buck.


00:31:33.790 --> 00:31:35.240
Indeed, Mr. William.


00:31:35.270 --> 00:31:37.500
That creature did not
appear to be dangerous.


00:31:38.630 --> 00:31:41.790
Let us hurry, we have to find
a safe place for the night.


00:32:09.770 --> 00:32:10.970
Hmm.


00:32:11.000 --> 00:32:12.460
What a boring day.


00:32:12.490 --> 00:32:14.770
I didn't even get a single creature.


00:32:24.440 --> 00:32:27.000
A probe will come eventually, right?


00:32:33.740 --> 00:32:34.940
Huh?


00:32:38.040 --> 00:32:39.240
Um.


00:32:42.600 --> 00:32:44.620
Ahh, missed another one.


00:32:44.650 --> 00:32:46.380
I'm sick of this.


00:32:51.185 --> 00:32:52.385
Uh.


00:32:52.415 --> 00:32:53.615
Huh?


00:33:01.820 --> 00:33:03.160
Wow.


00:33:03.190 --> 00:33:04.500
Amazing!


00:33:04.530 --> 00:33:06.140
There's a whole family here.


00:33:25.740 --> 00:33:27.120
Thanks Buck.


00:33:27.150 --> 00:33:29.090
You are welcome, Mr. William.


00:34:11.850 --> 00:34:14.700
Mr. William's safety, okay.


00:34:14.730 --> 00:34:17.070
Signal strength, okay.


00:34:17.100 --> 00:34:19.410
Battery level, 50%.


00:34:19.440 --> 00:34:22.410
Recommendation, temporary sleep mode.


00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:52.960
Hurry up.


00:34:52.990 --> 00:34:55.250
We must find a place to
set up our base camp.


00:34:56.150 --> 00:34:58.990
I know Buck, but I'm super hungry.


00:35:00.340 --> 00:35:01.540
Woah.


00:35:12.290 --> 00:35:14.650
Ha ha ha ha.


00:35:15.430 --> 00:35:16.980
Ha ha.


00:35:17.590 --> 00:35:19.980
Huh? What is that?


00:35:21.690 --> 00:35:22.890
Huh?


00:35:26.330 --> 00:35:27.570
Poor thing.


00:35:28.370 --> 00:35:30.390
We can't just leave him like that.


00:35:39.980 --> 00:35:42.160
Remain completely still.


00:35:54.340 --> 00:35:55.540
Wow.


00:35:56.820 --> 00:35:59.230
That alarm system is cool.


00:35:59.260 --> 00:36:02.340
I'm sure even my parents
never saw something like that.


00:36:03.240 --> 00:36:05.990
Oh, I didn't even take a photo.


00:36:10.050 --> 00:36:12.170
Ugh, I'm still hungry.


00:36:13.950 --> 00:36:15.670
Analysis, okay.


00:36:15.700 --> 00:36:17.940
No toxic substance detected.


00:36:23.310 --> 00:36:24.510
Hm?


00:36:24.680 --> 00:36:25.880
Bahg.


00:36:25.910 --> 00:36:27.630
It burns..


00:36:30.080 --> 00:36:31.620
Analysis okay.


00:36:39.530 --> 00:36:41.270
Analysis okay.


00:36:58.340 --> 00:36:59.650
Analysis okay.


00:36:59.680 --> 00:37:01.970
Ah, are you really sure this time Buck?


00:37:02.270 --> 00:37:04.050
Absolutely, Mr. William.


00:37:04.080 --> 00:37:05.860
No risk of side effects.


00:37:09.060 --> 00:37:11.570
This planet's vegetation
is full of surprises.


00:37:14.720 --> 00:37:16.755
In addition, it's contents


00:37:16.785 --> 00:37:18.820
seem extremely sticky.


00:37:28.270 --> 00:37:29.470
Huh?


00:37:30.590 --> 00:37:32.270
Okay, I'll help you.


00:37:40.720 --> 00:37:41.920
Mr. William?


00:37:41.950 --> 00:37:43.150
Everything alright?


00:37:47.800 --> 00:37:49.690
Mr. William? Are you there?


00:38:00.580 --> 00:38:01.820
Interesting.


00:38:03.520 --> 00:38:05.620
The plant's content dries very quickly,


00:38:05.650 --> 00:38:07.090
then becomes quite brittle.


00:38:31.560 --> 00:38:34.270
This place will be
perfect for our base camp.


00:38:40.440 --> 00:38:41.890
Flash?


00:38:47.770 --> 00:38:49.950
I'm so happy to see you again.


00:39:04.740 --> 00:39:06.850
Yum, that looks so good.


00:39:10.310 --> 00:39:11.730
Thank you.


00:39:13.920 --> 00:39:15.120
Um.


00:39:16.710 --> 00:39:17.910
Umm.


00:39:25.860 --> 00:39:27.890
Don't worry, I'll talk to him.


00:39:29.100 --> 00:39:30.440
Buck! Stop.


00:39:30.470 --> 00:39:31.760
Stop.


00:39:34.840 --> 00:39:36.780
What do you have against him anyway?


00:39:36.810 --> 00:39:39.760
I already informed you of the
uselessness of this creature.


00:39:39.790 --> 00:39:40.560
What?


00:39:40.590 --> 00:39:42.360
You really don't get it, do you?


00:39:42.770 --> 00:39:45.540
I finally meet a friend,
and you chase him away.


00:39:45.900 --> 00:39:47.260
Thanks.


00:39:47.290 --> 00:39:49.120
You are welcome, Mr. William.


00:39:59.570 --> 00:40:01.600
Human psychology database -


00:40:01.900 --> 00:40:05.990
Displays of affection miay improve
the subjects emotional state.


00:40:21.240 --> 00:40:23.050
Is everything all right, Mr. William?


00:40:23.080 --> 00:40:24.780
No, not really.


00:40:25.720 --> 00:40:28.390
We've been on this planet
for several days now,


00:40:28.600 --> 00:40:31.270
and there's still no
news from my parents.


00:40:31.710 --> 00:40:33.950
Are you sure that probe will come by?


00:40:34.590 --> 00:40:37.100
Yes, soon Mr. William.


00:40:38.500 --> 00:40:39.900
Soon.


00:40:49.400 --> 00:40:50.600
Flash.


00:40:50.630 --> 00:40:51.830
Shh.


00:40:54.070 --> 00:40:55.800
It's okay, he's not around.


00:40:57.040 --> 00:40:58.240
Fetch!


00:41:00.770 --> 00:41:02.720
Quick Flash, go hide.


00:41:04.580 --> 00:41:05.990
Careful, Mr. William.


00:41:06.020 --> 00:41:07.990
Dead branches are
falling from the trees.


00:41:08.020 --> 00:41:09.280
Oh, yeah?


00:41:09.870 --> 00:41:11.120
Kinda weird, huh?


00:41:12.530 --> 00:41:13.900
Come on, let us go back.


00:41:13.930 --> 00:41:15.960
We have to get to the
camp to build a hut.


00:41:15.990 --> 00:41:19.620
Well, I don't see the point since
you said we're leaving soon.


00:41:19.650 --> 00:41:23.310
Mr. William, soon could mean
several weeks, you realise.


00:41:24.270 --> 00:41:26.590
Don't you think you're exagerrating?


00:41:30.470 --> 00:41:31.710
Uh, gotta go.


00:41:31.740 --> 00:41:33.430
I really need to... you know.


00:41:33.460 --> 00:41:34.990
I will come with you, Mr. William.


00:41:35.020 --> 00:41:38.000
Uh, no thanks,
I think I can manage on my own.


00:41:38.030 --> 00:41:40.055
And it might actually take a while.


00:41:40.085 --> 00:41:42.080
I feel it's gonna be a big one.


00:41:42.110 --> 00:41:44.240
But don't worry,
I'll call you if there's a problem.


00:41:48.670 --> 00:41:50.430
Have a good poop, Mr. William.


00:41:53.590 --> 00:41:55.480
I won't miss it this time.


00:42:07.900 --> 00:42:09.910
Oh no, what did I do?


00:42:14.640 --> 00:42:16.220
I'm really sorry.


00:42:20.180 --> 00:42:22.130
Wait, I'll try and fix it.


00:42:28.031 --> 00:42:30.331
I'm just trying to
help you Don't worry.


00:42:32.690 --> 00:42:33.920
Hmm.


00:42:48.690 --> 00:42:50.255
Come on. Stop.


00:42:50.285 --> 00:42:51.687
Let me do it.


00:42:51.717 --> 00:42:53.120
You'll see.


00:42:59.940 --> 00:43:01.400
Now hold still.


00:43:04.770 --> 00:43:06.280
There you go.


00:43:16.620 --> 00:43:17.880
It worked, Flash.


00:43:21.360 --> 00:43:23.650
Okay, not too long though,


00:43:23.680 --> 00:43:25.970
or Buck will be suspicious.


00:43:26.540 --> 00:43:29.490
Mr. William, Mr.
William, are you there?


00:43:33.570 --> 00:43:34.960
Mr. William?


00:43:38.590 --> 00:43:40.500
Mr. William, are you there?


00:43:45.180 --> 00:43:49.260
Mr. William?


00:43:58.210 --> 00:43:59.710
Wow.


00:44:15.360 --> 00:44:16.625
Yeah!


00:44:16.655 --> 00:44:17.920
Whoo-hoo!


00:44:18.950 --> 00:44:20.610
Yi haa!


00:44:30.110 --> 00:44:32.130
Wow Flash, that was awesome.


00:44:36.750 --> 00:44:37.950
Huh?


00:44:50.760 --> 00:44:52.570
You lied to me, Mr. William.


00:44:52.600 --> 00:44:54.240
I have been looking all over for you.


00:44:54.670 --> 00:44:55.900
I'm sorry.


00:44:55.930 --> 00:44:57.780
We just wanted to have some fun.


00:44:57.920 --> 00:44:59.990
Besides, nothing bad happened.


00:45:00.020 --> 00:45:02.145
In order to protect you efficiently,


00:45:02.175 --> 00:45:04.300
I must know where you are at all times.


00:45:04.330 --> 00:45:06.040
Yeah, I know.


00:45:08.020 --> 00:45:09.290
Come along.


00:45:14.440 --> 00:45:16.140
Ouch, it stings.


00:45:21.320 --> 00:45:22.610
Flash?


00:45:24.340 --> 00:45:25.540
Huh?


00:45:27.570 --> 00:45:28.870
Buck!


00:45:30.630 --> 00:45:32.760
Buck, what's happening to me?


00:45:36.530 --> 00:45:39.800
Subject contaminated
by unknown substance.


00:45:39.830 --> 00:45:41.880
Vitals declining.


00:45:45.350 --> 00:45:46.560
What happened to you?


00:45:51.860 --> 00:45:54.930
Plant Category 4 caliber 9.


00:45:54.960 --> 00:45:56.350
Maximum danger.


00:45:56.380 --> 00:45:58.890
Recommendation: Search for antidote.


00:46:01.260 --> 00:46:03.100
Antidote not identified.


00:46:06.730 --> 00:46:09.020
Antidote not identified.


00:46:12.010 --> 00:46:13.790
Antidote not identified.


00:46:19.060 --> 00:46:20.660
Heart rate: Dropping.


00:46:20.690 --> 00:46:23.440
Subjects chance of
survival: Compromised.


00:46:34.300 --> 00:46:35.500
Willy?


00:46:37.710 --> 00:46:39.140
Willy?


00:46:42.040 --> 00:46:43.520
- Willy.
- Willy.


00:46:44.230 --> 00:46:46.070
Dad? Mom?


00:46:46.600 --> 00:46:48.230
We're here my love.


00:46:49.030 --> 00:46:51.610
I made progress in my mission, look.


00:46:57.260 --> 00:47:00.520
Great job, you're a real explorer.


00:47:03.370 --> 00:47:05.690
When are you guys coming to get me?


00:47:05.880 --> 00:47:07.640
We don't know yet.


00:47:07.670 --> 00:47:10.370
You're big enough to
make it without us now.


00:47:10.400 --> 00:47:11.870
Huh?


00:47:14.430 --> 00:47:16.770
No, don't leave me, please.


00:47:27.300 --> 00:47:29.700
No! Please!


00:47:34.810 --> 00:47:38.050
Protection mission failure.


00:47:56.070 --> 00:47:57.270
Flash?


00:48:06.260 --> 00:48:09.390
Mr William's safety, okay.


00:48:10.390 --> 00:48:12.170
You will feel better in no time.


00:48:14.000 --> 00:48:15.640
Let us go.


00:48:20.540 --> 00:48:22.540
Perhaps Mr. Flash can come join us.


00:48:22.570 --> 00:48:24.440
What? Really?


00:48:24.720 --> 00:48:26.650
Flash, you can come with us.


00:49:23.100 --> 00:49:24.640
I slept so well.


00:49:24.670 --> 00:49:26.020
Come on Flash, we...


00:49:26.050 --> 00:49:27.550
Huh? Flash?


00:49:30.080 --> 00:49:31.720
Buck, Buck, come quick.


00:49:31.750 --> 00:49:33.450
There's something wrong with Flash.


00:49:38.750 --> 00:49:39.950
Do not worry.


00:49:39.980 --> 00:49:42.710
Your friend Flash is just
going through a metamorphosis.


00:49:43.870 --> 00:49:45.750
And he is in a state of hatching.


00:49:46.330 --> 00:49:47.820
Awesome.


00:49:52.680 --> 00:49:54.300
Not so awesome.


00:50:01.440 --> 00:50:03.270
Flash, you okay?


00:50:05.750 --> 00:50:06.950
Woah!


00:50:09.470 --> 00:50:10.670
Woah.


00:50:11.470 --> 00:50:12.670
Ah.


00:50:24.810 --> 00:50:26.010
Ha ha ha.


00:51:00.370 --> 00:51:02.030
Say "cheese ".


00:51:02.800 --> 00:51:04.440
Oh no Flash.


00:51:30.990 --> 00:51:33.570
I can't wait to show mom
and dad what we've made.


00:51:35.150 --> 00:51:37.250
I wish they were here with us.


00:51:38.790 --> 00:51:41.220
They would be very proud of you,
Mr. William.


00:51:42.250 --> 00:51:43.960
Give me 5.


00:51:52.060 --> 00:51:53.260
Huh?


00:51:53.460 --> 00:51:54.870
Hehehe.


00:51:56.190 --> 00:51:57.600
Come on, let's eat.


00:51:59.060 --> 00:52:00.260
Oh.


00:52:02.660 --> 00:52:04.600
You could've left me a little bit.


00:52:08.170 --> 00:52:10.090
Okay, I'll go get some more.


00:52:29.720 --> 00:52:30.920
Flash?


00:52:39.790 --> 00:52:41.550
Did you just make a joke, Buck?


00:52:41.580 --> 00:52:43.170
I believe so, Mr. William.


00:52:43.200 --> 00:52:44.400
Hehehe.


00:52:46.650 --> 00:52:48.530
Yeah, you made a joke.


00:52:49.039 --> 00:52:50.539
Did you see that Flash?


00:52:50.540 --> 00:52:52.350
Buck made a joke.


00:52:57.620 --> 00:52:59.710
Yuck, that's gross.


00:53:15.020 --> 00:53:16.960
Let us find shelter.


00:53:20.140 --> 00:53:21.690
Come on Flash.


00:53:21.890 --> 00:53:24.850
Don't worry, it's only
thunder, you're safe.


00:53:32.790 --> 00:53:34.730
What a chicken.


00:54:05.670 --> 00:54:07.340
Hail is coming down.


00:54:07.370 --> 00:54:09.640
Maybe we better go find Flash.


00:54:10.230 --> 00:54:12.570
Excellent idea, Mr. William.


00:54:35.130 --> 00:54:36.330
Woah.


00:54:37.000 --> 00:54:38.200
Huh?


00:54:47.860 --> 00:54:49.970
Wow, great shield protector.


00:54:51.820 --> 00:54:53.020
Thanks Buck.


00:54:53.300 --> 00:54:55.260
What would I ever do without you?


00:54:57.280 --> 00:54:59.580
Alert! Battery level low.


00:55:21.350 --> 00:55:22.550
Huh?


00:55:28.210 --> 00:55:30.590
Wow, that was quite a hail storm.


00:55:31.460 --> 00:55:32.950
Hey Flash.


00:55:32.980 --> 00:55:34.405
Alright. You okay?


00:55:34.435 --> 00:55:35.860
What about you Buck?


00:55:35.890 --> 00:55:37.090
Are you okay?


00:55:37.510 --> 00:55:39.580
Yes Mr. William, everything is okay.


00:55:40.000 --> 00:55:42.280
But I am going to have
to leave you for a while.


00:55:42.310 --> 00:55:43.510
What?


00:55:44.260 --> 00:55:47.320
Oh, you're making another joke, right?


00:55:47.760 --> 00:55:48.960
Not at all.


00:55:49.580 --> 00:55:52.670
Activating the shield nearly
depleted my battery reserve.


00:55:53.090 --> 00:55:55.200
I have to switch to power saving mode.


00:55:55.230 --> 00:55:57.440
And what does that mean?


00:55:57.470 --> 00:55:59.170
I shall enter total sleep mode


00:55:59.200 --> 00:56:00.870
and prioritize the transmitter.


00:56:00.900 --> 00:56:04.320
Oh but, you can't just turn
yourself off like that.


00:56:04.350 --> 00:56:06.960
I am sorry, it is the best option.


00:56:06.990 --> 00:56:09.305
No! You can't do that, I need you.


00:56:09.335 --> 00:56:11.542
You will manage very well without me.


00:56:11.572 --> 00:56:13.780
In any case, I will power back on


00:56:13.810 --> 00:56:15.350
when a probe is detected.


00:56:15.380 --> 00:56:17.780
In the meantime, rely on Mr. Flash.


00:56:17.810 --> 00:56:20.180
He knows this planet quite well.


00:56:20.210 --> 00:56:22.310
He will help you achieve your mission.


00:56:22.340 --> 00:56:23.670
You may have to be patient,


00:56:23.700 --> 00:56:26.090
but whatever happens, be careful.


00:56:28.010 --> 00:56:29.770
Goodbye for now, Mr. William.


00:56:41.160 --> 00:56:43.270
I need you Buck, don't go away.


00:57:25.140 --> 00:57:27.790
Don't worry, I won't
let you down, okay.


00:57:27.820 --> 00:57:29.260
You're gonna be safe in here.


00:57:33.720 --> 00:57:35.840
Alright, I found one.


00:57:37.770 --> 00:57:39.720
You'll see Buck, we'll wake you up.


00:57:42.130 --> 00:57:43.590
This is what we need to get.


00:57:44.830 --> 00:57:46.030
Ready?


00:57:47.100 --> 00:57:48.300
What's the matter?


00:57:49.180 --> 00:57:51.620
Rock monsters? That's
what's scaring you?


00:57:52.070 --> 00:57:54.820
Don't worry, if we're quiet,
they won't see us.


00:57:54.850 --> 00:57:56.050
C'mon. Let's go.


00:57:58.620 --> 00:58:00.625
Stop, let me go, I have to.


00:58:00.655 --> 00:58:02.660
We can't leave Buck like this.


00:58:02.690 --> 00:58:04.280
Just wait me here.


00:58:04.310 --> 00:58:05.900
I'll go alone.


00:58:14.070 --> 00:58:15.380
Flash?


00:58:16.160 --> 00:58:17.830
Hey Flash, be careful.


00:58:17.860 --> 00:58:19.170
Not so fast.


00:58:54.970 --> 00:58:56.670
Run, Flash.


00:59:18.170 --> 00:59:19.475
Flash?


00:59:19.505 --> 00:59:20.810
Flash.


00:59:26.140 --> 00:59:29.140
I'm so sorry I put you
in so much danger.


00:59:30.200 --> 00:59:32.250
I don't want to lose you too.


00:59:35.800 --> 00:59:38.800
Don't you worry, I'll take care of you.


01:00:17.440 --> 01:00:19.490
Whatever you do, don't move.


01:00:27.210 --> 01:00:28.560
Huh?


01:00:44.050 --> 01:00:46.440
I'm okay Flash, I'll be right with you.


01:01:34.200 --> 01:01:35.735
Anyone!


01:01:35.765 --> 01:01:37.207
Help me!


01:01:37.237 --> 01:01:38.680
Please!


01:01:39.900 --> 01:01:41.240
Help me!


01:01:45.190 --> 01:01:46.860
Help me!


01:01:48.390 --> 01:01:49.990
Anyone?


01:01:52.830 --> 01:01:54.770
I'll nevermake it out of here.


01:01:57.220 --> 01:01:59.640
I'll never see my parents again.


01:02:26.340 --> 01:02:27.540
Huh?


01:03:30.540 --> 01:03:32.220
Okay now, don't move.


01:03:33.600 --> 01:03:35.380
This time it has to work.


01:03:49.470 --> 01:03:50.880
You okay, Flash?


01:03:55.330 --> 01:03:57.390
Thank you, you saved my life.


01:04:13.250 --> 01:04:16.040
Hang in there Flash,
we'll be home soon.


01:04:32.320 --> 01:04:33.690
You're right Buck.


01:04:33.720 --> 01:04:35.630
I can't just do whatever I want.


01:04:38.530 --> 01:04:41.530
The most important thing is that
you keep sending the signal.


01:04:41.560 --> 01:04:42.990
So we get rescued.


01:04:43.620 --> 01:04:46.670
Together with Flash,
I'll keep exploring the planet.


01:04:59.470 --> 01:05:03.010
You'll see,
I'll protect you and you'll protect me.


01:05:03.040 --> 01:05:05.150
Together, nothing can bring us down.


01:05:09.910 --> 01:05:13.510
Mom, dad, I'll wait for you,


01:05:13.540 --> 01:05:15.550
as long as I have to.


01:05:29.999 --> 01:05:33.099
TEN MONTHS LATER


01:05:36.400 --> 01:05:38.390
I'm gonna catch you Flash.


01:05:55.330 --> 01:05:56.940
You're sucked!


01:06:36.000 --> 01:06:37.620
Alright, we're here.


01:06:41.210 --> 01:06:42.410
But Flash,


01:06:42.440 --> 01:06:44.830
We've been working on
this plan for weeks.


01:06:44.860 --> 01:06:46.680
You can't just eat all the bait.


01:06:54.590 --> 01:06:56.510
It comes through here every day.


01:06:56.540 --> 01:06:59.680
With all this bait, it
should show up soon.


01:07:00.740 --> 01:07:03.710
Stop making noise,
or it's gonna zero in on us again.


01:07:03.740 --> 01:07:06.190
We've missed it at least 50 times.


01:07:08.270 --> 01:07:09.590
What?


01:07:09.620 --> 01:07:11.100
Already?


01:07:11.130 --> 01:07:12.580
Oh no.


01:07:12.610 --> 01:07:14.050
Come on, it's okay.


01:07:16.260 --> 01:07:18.240
You chase him over to the urchins.


01:07:18.270 --> 01:07:20.250
I'll go this way, it's a shortcut.


01:07:44.770 --> 01:07:45.970
Huh?


01:07:46.910 --> 01:07:48.110
Oh!


01:08:15.560 --> 01:08:17.360
You're welcome.


01:08:17.920 --> 01:08:19.120
Uhh.


01:08:25.540 --> 01:08:27.380
Yeah, well done Flash.


01:08:31.900 --> 01:08:33.230
Hmmm.


01:09:08.160 --> 01:09:09.360
Huh?


01:09:09.390 --> 01:09:11.090
We got it?


01:09:11.630 --> 01:09:13.010
We got it?


01:09:13.040 --> 01:09:15.330
We got it! We got it Flash!


01:09:15.360 --> 01:09:16.795
We got it! We got it!


01:09:16.825 --> 01:09:18.260
We got it! Come on.


01:09:18.290 --> 01:09:19.540
High 5!


01:09:26.250 --> 01:09:27.620
You're the best.


01:10:02.290 --> 01:10:03.820
You know what?


01:10:03.850 --> 01:10:05.635
We're an awesome team together.


01:10:05.665 --> 01:10:07.450
This is a really super collection.


01:10:21.980 --> 01:10:23.985
Here you go, the popcorn is ready.


01:10:24.015 --> 01:10:26.020
Let's go over to the living room.


01:11:09.540 --> 01:11:10.880
Wait.


01:11:10.910 --> 01:11:12.400
I can't believe it.


01:11:15.510 --> 01:11:16.970
Is that a...


01:11:17.520 --> 01:11:19.140
a probe?


01:11:21.130 --> 01:11:24.340
So then...
this means someone is really coming.


01:11:27.870 --> 01:11:29.860
I'm going to see my parents.


01:11:30.950 --> 01:11:32.150
And Buck.


01:11:32.180 --> 01:11:34.940
He said he would turn back
on when the probe came by.


01:11:34.970 --> 01:11:36.560
Buck is going to wake up.


01:11:36.590 --> 01:11:38.180
Come on, let's go get him.


01:11:41.400 --> 01:11:42.660
Ahh.


01:11:46.930 --> 01:11:49.240
Okay, I'll get him myself.


01:11:55.980 --> 01:11:58.000
Buck, what are you doing, come on.


01:11:58.030 --> 01:12:00.050
Wake up, a probe is flying by.


01:12:18.730 --> 01:12:19.930
Huh?


01:12:20.020 --> 01:12:22.210
It's completely empty.


01:12:22.240 --> 01:12:24.480
You can't even send a signal anymore.


01:13:32.220 --> 01:13:33.710
Go and hide until I get back.


01:13:48.220 --> 01:13:50.190
This time I can't wake them up.


01:15:06.920 --> 01:15:08.670
No gas, super.


01:16:13.760 --> 01:16:15.870
Yeah, we made it!


01:16:16.115 --> 01:16:17.315
Woah.


01:16:17.345 --> 01:16:18.545
Ugh.


01:16:56.430 --> 01:16:57.770
Flash.


01:17:06.880 --> 01:17:08.700
Flash, we have to turn around.


01:17:09.790 --> 01:17:12.920
You go find the battery,
and we'll clear the way, okay?


01:17:36.820 --> 01:17:38.020
Hmm.


01:18:09.170 --> 01:18:12.340
Oh no, I'll never project that far.


01:18:25.350 --> 01:18:27.120
Time for fruit jam, my man.


01:18:45.770 --> 01:18:47.460
Huh? There's more?


01:18:47.490 --> 01:18:49.480
They'll never get off our backs.


01:18:49.970 --> 01:18:51.260
Brake!


01:18:54.910 --> 01:18:56.640
Flash, catch!


01:19:21.230 --> 01:19:22.750
Say "cheese ".


01:19:24.480 --> 01:19:26.225
Thank's for the picture.


01:19:26.255 --> 01:19:28.000
Yeah, collection complete!


01:19:28.560 --> 01:19:30.660
Hurry, let's go back to Buck.


01:19:58.340 --> 01:19:59.570
Buck.


01:20:07.110 --> 01:20:09.250
Mr. William, is that you?


01:20:09.570 --> 01:20:11.380
Well, who else?


01:20:13.810 --> 01:20:16.050
I really missed you, rust bucket.


01:20:16.280 --> 01:20:17.890
You disobeyed my orders again.


01:20:17.920 --> 01:20:19.120
Huh?


01:20:19.360 --> 01:20:22.950
You must have taken enormous risks
to retrieve this new battery.


01:20:23.250 --> 01:20:25.650
Yeah, but. uh... That is incredible!


01:20:25.680 --> 01:20:28.080
How couragous, I am so proud of you.


01:20:29.950 --> 01:20:31.380
And that big creature..


01:20:31.410 --> 01:20:33.060
Is it... Oh.


01:20:35.190 --> 01:20:37.310
It is. It is you, Mr. Flash.


01:20:46.250 --> 01:20:47.860
The probe picked up our signal.


01:20:47.980 --> 01:20:49.210
That is it, Mr. William.


01:20:49.660 --> 01:20:51.530
You are finally going home.


01:20:55.340 --> 01:20:56.710
I'm going home.


01:21:06.480 --> 01:21:08.810
The probe is sending us a message.


01:21:08.840 --> 01:21:10.030
Greetings.


01:21:10.060 --> 01:21:13.420
This is search probe RO-0612.


01:21:13.450 --> 01:21:16.030
Your rescue request has been processed.


01:21:16.280 --> 01:21:20.460
An automatic retrieval pod will
arrive in less than 24 hours.


01:21:29.920 --> 01:21:31.740
This one's really cool, I'll take it.


01:21:31.770 --> 01:21:34.290
Yeah, it should fit,
and they have to taste this.


01:21:34.320 --> 01:21:35.780
We don't have these on earth.


01:21:35.810 --> 01:21:37.910
Oh and this, mom and dad will love it.


01:21:37.940 --> 01:21:40.040
Oh and... Come on, hurry up, Mr.
William.


01:21:40.300 --> 01:21:42.440
The rescue pod will be landing shortly.


01:21:42.470 --> 01:21:44.450
I'm trying to Buck.


01:21:46.370 --> 01:21:47.570
Hmm.


01:21:50.320 --> 01:21:52.060
Thank you for everything


01:21:52.090 --> 01:21:54.760
I would never be able
to go home without you.


01:21:55.270 --> 01:21:56.470
Goodbye my friend.


01:22:24.250 --> 01:22:25.790
Well, what're you waiting for?


01:22:25.820 --> 01:22:27.020
Come on, don't worry.


01:22:27.050 --> 01:22:29.450
It's okay, there's enough
space for the three of us.


01:22:32.680 --> 01:22:34.160
What're you doing?


01:22:38.510 --> 01:22:39.870
I don't understand.


01:22:41.650 --> 01:22:44.500
I believe it is time to say goodbye,
Mr. William.


01:22:44.530 --> 01:22:45.760
Huh? What?


01:22:59.770 --> 01:23:01.260
So you're not coming?


01:23:13.380 --> 01:23:15.260
We have to go, Mr. William.


01:23:19.330 --> 01:23:21.110
Goodbye, Mr. Flash.


01:23:31.070 --> 01:23:33.080
Goodbye Flash.


01:24:06.300 --> 01:24:07.710
Oh there you are.


01:24:09.730 --> 01:24:11.880
I'll come back to see you Flash.


01:24:11.910 --> 01:24:13.110
I promise.


01:25:35.100 --> 01:25:36.300
Dad?


01:25:36.330 --> 01:25:37.530
Mom?


01:25:39.070 --> 01:25:40.455
Dad! Mom!


01:25:40.485 --> 01:25:41.870
Willy!


01:25:54.920 --> 01:25:56.670
Are you alright?


01:25:56.700 --> 01:25:58.690
Yeah, yeah, I'm okay.


01:26:05.440 --> 01:26:07.780
But I have to tell you,
it was unbelievable!


01:26:07.810 --> 01:26:09.570
I made a friend, his name is Flash.


01:26:09.600 --> 01:26:12.880
He helped me complete my mission,
and Buck - he's an awesome robot.


01:26:12.910 --> 01:26:13.970
And the rock monsters.


01:26:14.000 --> 01:26:16.890
Flash and I beat them because we
had to get a battery for Buck.


01:26:16.920 --> 01:26:20.520
And there was a beetle, I broke his
horn, but I didn't mean to though...


01:26:20.550 --> 01:26:22.810
We reached earth a few days later.


01:26:22.840 --> 01:26:24.390
It was just incredible.


01:26:24.420 --> 01:26:27.310
Everybody was amazed by my collection.


01:26:27.590 --> 01:26:30.080
Of course, I think about
Flash all the time,


01:26:30.110 --> 01:26:31.610
and I miss him a lot.


01:26:31.640 --> 01:26:34.990
Sometimes, I wonder why he didn't
want to come with me to earth.


01:26:35.020 --> 01:26:37.010
But then I think, if I were him,


01:26:37.040 --> 01:26:39.180
I would want to stay
on that planet too.


01:26:39.210 --> 01:26:40.790
It's his home, after all.


01:26:40.820 --> 01:26:42.360
His planet.


01:26:42.680 --> 01:26:43.880
I guess..


01:26:43.910 --> 01:26:46.550
Now it's kinda mine too.


01:26:48.580 --> 01:26:59.580
@instagram.com/N3krA

